<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - CSS H1 NET PROFIT UP 42 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CSS H1 NET PROFIT UP 42 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HOUTEN, Netherlands 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 to June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.31 vs   0.22</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.53 vs   1.08</p>
<p>    Turnover				12.34 vs   9.37</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     2.24 vs   1.71</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    0.01 vs   0.005</p>
<p>    Tax					0.78 vs   0.61</p>
<p>    Associates			     0.08 vs   0.02 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Computer Services Solutions Holding NV said that</p>
<p>barring unforeseen circumstances it expected to book full-year</p>
<p>profit growth in line with that achieved in the first 1997</p>
<p>half. The company was floated on the new companies section</p>
<p>of the Amsterdam Stock Exchange (NMAX) on April 25, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
